{"run_id": "run_a3b41603801e", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_007", "task_id": "course_live_task", "scenario_id": "s07_busy", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "您好，请问您是贵培训机构或校区的负责人吗？"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，有什么事？我正在上课，请简短说。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，打扰了。是关于课程发布页面的更新：新增了“标准直播”和“低延迟直播”两个选项，原有流程不变。您之前用的是低延迟链路，新选项让您根据课程场景选择。我稍后给您发企业微信通知，您看现在方便简单确认一下吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "我现在很忙，没时间细看。能不能晚点再联系？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "完全理解。那我预约今天下午3点再打给您，可以吗？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "好的，下午3点可以。"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，已记录。下午3点再联系您，祝您上课顺利，再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 5, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "course_live_task", "preferred_time": "2025-03-21T15:00:00"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
